name: Recorded campaign progress stays visible through reading input resize and restart
size: 40x12
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_report.py @TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | compact-progress
expect: PgUp/PgDn
type: kept scan draft
require-live-snap: 15 kept scan draft | composer-draft
expect: Jobs: 24 · 24 completed
keys: NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | paged-with-draft
expect: kept scan draft
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | draft-160x48
expect: kept scan draft
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | draft-120x36
expect: kept scan draft
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | draft-96x89
expect: kept scan draft
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | draft-80x24
expect: kept scan draft
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | draft-60x20
expect: kept scan draft
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | draft-40x12
expect: kept scan draft
ask: Do the actual completed workload and paging controls stay readable while the composer draft survives paging and all six viewport sizes?
keys: C-u
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 Esc compose | compact-navigation
keys: j Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SELECTED JOB | selected-job
expect: Jobs: 24 · 24 completed
keys: NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | detail-paged
keys: q
require-live-snap: 15 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | returned-jobs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_report.py @TARGET @ART read
ask: Does Enter still inspect the selected recorded job and q return to its list, with truthful counts and no new work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Jobs: 24 · 24 completed | recovered-compact-progress
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_report.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does the forty-column no-color restart show the same exact completed workload immediately, with unchanged source plan queue observations decisions and allowance?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
